**Quick wins to try:** Try creating custom slash commands (/commands) for your recurring workflows like code review sweeps and dictionary/config debugging — you repeat these patterns often enough that a reusable skill would save setup time each session. Also consider setting up hooks to auto-run build verification or lint checks after edits, which would catch issues like the unintended file commits before they happen. See _Features to Try_.

